{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37444","headline":"贺李昌时禁苑新命 · 唐彦谦","name":"贺李昌时禁苑新命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉简金文直上清，禁垣丹地闭严扃。\n黄扉议政参元化，紫殿称觞拂寿星。\n万户千门迷步武，非烟非雾隔仪形。\n尘中旧侣无音信，知道辽东鹤姓丁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}